{"id":"n79480-1-9","stage":5,"title":"최적 · 最佳","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79480-1-9-1","ko":"이번 발표를 누구에게 맡겨야 할지 모르겠습니다.","zh":"我不知道这次汇报该交给谁来做。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"발표를","meaning":"发表，发布","explanation":"발표：发表，发布；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62470","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발표를","audio":"/audio/fb8eecedd8451fb146ac.mp3"}},{"text":"누구에게","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구에게","audio":"/audio/ad8356f0cd408b25bef2.mp3"}},{"text":"맡겨야","meaning":"交给，交付","explanation":"맡기다：交给，交付；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"맡기다","audio":"/audio/e2fc4d9a742ac29aee5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64685","senseId":"1","lemma":"맡기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맡겨야","audio":"/audio/e0cb3ebee04feb108b64.mp3"}},{"text":"할지","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할지","audio":"/audio/156fd116c75acec033e4.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠습니다.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠습니다","audio":"/audio/6e1b066913cf52de971e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"662fbb8d7bdeae80","term":"발표","zh":"发表，发布","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3","entryId":"62470","definition":"向世人公开并传播某种事实、结果或作品等。","pronunciation":["발표"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"e2fc4d9a742ac29a","term":"맡기다","zh":"交给，交付","audio":"/audio/e2fc4d9a742ac29aee5e.mp3","entryId":"64685","definition":"让某人负责并处理某事。","pronunciation":["맏끼다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ab94b8901e1268227f68.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79480-1-9-2","ko":"김 부장에게 맡기지. 말을 매우 잘하니 최적의 인물이야.","zh":"交给金部长吧。他讲话非常出色，是最合适的人选。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）。","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"부장에게","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부장에게","audio":"/audio/1f859959d4c39738fe97.mp3"}},{"text":"맡기지.","meaning":"交给，交付","explanation":"맡기다：交给，交付；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맡기다","audio":"/audio/e2fc4d9a742ac29aee5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64685","senseId":"1","lemma":"맡기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맡기지","audio":"/audio/bb717ce18700c72c9228.mp3"}},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말을","audio":"/audio/e897e0419e4ab64902fd.mp3"}},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}},{"text":"잘하니","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘하니","audio":"/audio/62e056ff4d79787e480e.mp3"}},{"text":"최적의","meaning":"最佳，最合适 ，最适合","explanation":"최적：最佳，最合适 ，最适合；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"최적","audio":"/audio/3f6c69a327b0ded2adae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79480","senseId":"1","lemma":"최적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"최적의","audio":"/audio/8835fa307fb7032b8787.mp3"}},{"text":"인물이야.","meaning":"人物，人才","explanation":"인물：人物，人才；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"인물","audio":"/audio/16673e931e1465c54d5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25066","senseId":"4","lemma":"인물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인물이야","audio":"/audio/e6b9f31ef836e916c2aa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01b3143b55839388","term":"부장","zh":"部长","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3","entryId":"59737","definition":"在机关、组织中负责管理一个部门的职位；或指在这个职位的人。","pronunciation":["부장"]},{"id":"e2fc4d9a742ac29a","term":"맡기다","zh":"交给，交付","audio":"/audio/e2fc4d9a742ac29aee5e.mp3","entryId":"64685","definition":"让某人负责并处理某事。","pronunciation":["맏끼다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"6226ddde2c49b372","term":"매우","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3","entryId":"61510","definition":"表示远远超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["매우"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"棒","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得好、优秀。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"3f6c69a327b0ded2","term":"최적","zh":"最佳，最合适 ，最适合","audio":"/audio/3f6c69a327b0ded2adae.mp3","entryId":"79480","definition":"最符合某种条件或标准等。","pronunciation":["최ː적","췌ː적"]},{"id":"16673e931e1465c5","term":"인물","zh":"人物，人才","audio":"/audio/16673e931e1465c54d5d.mp3","entryId":"25066","definition":"出色的人。","pronunciation":["인물"]}],"audio":"/audio/3fd39365451d0f2d70f8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.542,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79480","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我不知道这次汇报该交给谁来做。","交给金部长吧。他讲话非常出色，是最合适的人选。","你有买水果放着吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我不知道这次汇报该交给谁来做。","交给金部长吧。他讲话非常出色，是最合适的人选。","你有买水果放着吗？"],"answer":1}]}
